*INCLUDE, INPUT=on-caso-3JS_dura_orient.inp
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=LC,          MATERIAL=LC_MAT
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=SCLERA_PERI, MATERIAL=SCLERA_PERI_MAT
